{"title":"절대마신 [완결]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bEfx3c/dJMb9cuGQJN/pt34dA7hAoc8p1ACptD4kK&filename=th3","synopsis":"강한 자의 강호는 아름답다. 끝내주게 멋지다. 살맛난다.\n하지만 약자의 강호는 사납다. 죽여주게 독하다. 죽지 못해 산다.\n이게 강호다. 그리고 여기 이 강호를 살아가는 한 사내가 있다. \n잘나서, 멋져서, 강해서, 그래서 모든 것을 내려두고 떠날 수밖에 없었던 철무린.\n훌훌 다 털어버리고 바람 따라 강물 따라 자유롭게 살아가리라.\n기껏 마음 다잡고 떠났는데, 그랬는데! \n이놈의 강호는 자유롭기가 제일 어렵다. 마음대로 살 수가 없다.\n다시 돌아온 철무린의 새로운 강호행!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":276,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":213,"change":{"type":"up","amount":63}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":180,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":293,"change":{"type":"down","amount":113}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":294,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":270,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":265,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":274,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":235,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":237,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":239,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":221,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":224,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":243,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":276,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":279,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":284,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":282,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":285,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":290,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":294,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":